  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 197, 'Answer a coworker''s chat message in the same thread so the conversation stays easy to follow.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 198, 'Let people know at the start of a meeting when there will be a break, so they can plan around it.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 199, 'Send a quick "done" when you finish something you promised, so the person does not have to ask.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 200, 'Meet a delivery driver at the door if you are home, so they do not have to wait.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 201, 'Free up the meeting room at the end time today, so the next group can start on time too.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 202, 'Keep your morning email check short and reply to anything that only needs a sentence.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 203, 'Hang up a sales call politely the moment you know you are not interested.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 204, 'Let a friend''s reminder about a promise land kindly, and thank them rather than feeling bad.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 205, 'Give clear, short directions when a delivery driver calls, like the gate code and which door to use.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 206, 'Head to the bus stop a few minutes before the posted time, since buses sometimes come a little early.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 207, 'Write a clear, friendly no when you cannot help, without a long list of reasons.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 208, 'Pick one person to send the follow up after a meeting, so no one receives three versions.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 209, 'Leave one clear message when following up, with everything the person needs to answer in one go.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 210, 'Clean up your table at a food court so the next person can sit down sooner.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 211, 'Pick up your child, friend or neighbor at the time you agreed, and text if traffic shifts it even a little.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 212, 'Suggest two or three specific times when setting up a meeting, instead of asking "When are you free?"'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 213, 'Walk and talk with a colleague on a mild fall afternoon, finishing the loop when your meeting time is up.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 214, 'Give your roommate or partner early notice if you cannot do your share of the chores tonight.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 215, 'Count your items before joining an express lane, and choose a regular lane if you are over.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 216, 'Get to the parent teacher conference a few minutes early, with your questions written down.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 217, 'Say "No rush" when it is true, so the other person does not drop everything to answer you.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 218, 'Answer a question in a meeting with the short version first, and offer details only if someone asks.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 219, 'Call back someone whose call you promised to return before the end of the workday.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 220, 'Give your mail carrier a holiday card and a thank you for keeping so many deliveries on time.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 221, 'Let yourself arrive early to an interview, and use the extra minutes to breathe slowly and look around.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 222, 'Check that a link works before you send it, so no one has to write back asking for a new one.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 223, 'Give a speaker your full attention at a school or community meeting and keep your questions short.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 224, 'Write the reference or recommendation you agreed to give someone, and send it before their deadline.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 225, 'Pay attention to how relieved you feel when a call ends on time, and offer that to others.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 226, 'Thank someone today who waited for you, and keep it simple without a long apology.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 227, 'Give a group text a clear name, such as "Soccer carpool," so people know what it is for.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 228, 'Give your name and role in one sentence when introducing yourself at a meeting, then let the next person go.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 229, 'Let a group know early if you need to drop out of a shared project, so they can plan.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 230, 'Listen fully when someone gives you a minute of their time, without checking your phone.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 231, 'Breathe slowly at a red light if you feel late, and remind yourself that a few minutes never outweigh safety.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 232, 'Spell out what you mean instead of using shorthand the other person might not know.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 233, 'Notice how long your part of a meeting takes today and see where you could trim a minute next time.'),
