  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 235, 'Collect your pages from the shared printer right away so the tray stays clear for others.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 236, 'Meet a walking buddy at the corner at the exact time you agreed, and enjoy setting off together.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 237, 'Proofread names and dates in your message, since a wrong one leads to more messages.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 238, 'Offer to take notes at a meeting so everyone else can focus on the talk.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 239, 'Bring back the folding chairs you borrowed for the summer cookout before the weekend ends.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 240, 'Refill the water jug at work when you take the last cup.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 241, 'Fill the car with gas the night before an early trip so you are not adding a stop in the morning.'),
