  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 250, 'Keep your boarding pass and ID in hand at the airport security line.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 251, 'Think back on the last time you were late without judgment, and name one small thing that would have helped.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 252, 'Open a long email with a short summary for the reader who only has a minute.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 253, 'Step out of a call politely if a child or visitor needs you, and say when you will be back.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 254, 'Help with the fall chore you offered to share at home, like putting away the garden hose or swapping closets.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 255, 'Leave the space by the mailboxes or recycling bins clear, so neighbors can get in and out quickly.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 256, 'Ask a coworker how much notice they like when a meeting time needs to move.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 257, 'Leave a short note on a neighbor''s door with everything they need, like the time of a planned water shutoff, so they need not knock to ask.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 258, 'Plan a neighborhood potluck with a start time and an end time written on the invitation.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 259, 'Keep your word on a small thing, like texting when you get home, so friends can count on it.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 260, 'Tell a coworker who covered for you how much their help meant, in a sentence or two.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 261, 'Return from your lunch break at the time you said, so the coworker covering for you can take theirs.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 262, 'Send a thank you note after an interview or a favor within a day, in three warm sentences.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 263, 'Keep a video call with your manager to the topics you sent ahead.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 264, 'Offer a neighbor one small favor you can finish today, like bringing in their mail, and then do it.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 265, 'Keep your summer yard sale or porch pickup on schedule, and be there at the time you posted.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 266, 'Make sure your bus or train is running on its usual schedule before you leave this morning.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 267, 'Snap a photo of a sign or flyer and send it when a picture explains the details faster than typing.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 268, 'When a meeting drifts, gently suggest a separate time for the side topic.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 269, 'Admit it plainly when you forgot something you promised, apologize once, and fix it without a long story.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 270, 'Make room in a waiting area by moving your bag off the seat beside you.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 271, 'Download a map of the area before visiting a place with weak cell signal, so you can still find your way.'),
