  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 283, 'On a snowy morning, offer to move an in person meeting to a call so no one has to travel in bad weather.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 284, 'Lend something only if you can manage without it, and say when you would like it back.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 285, 'Smile at a server who is clearly busy, and keep your requests to one trip when you can.'),
