  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 310, 'Give a neighbor a quick wave instead of starting a long chat when they are clearly in a hurry.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 311, 'Set up your parking app or find coins for the meter tonight, so paying for parking takes seconds tomorrow.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 312, 'Text directions for parking and the door to use before a party you are hosting, so guests are not calling from the curb.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 313, 'Check with a coworker before a quick chat at their desk whether now is a good time.'),
