  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 316, 'Smile and move on after arriving late today, knowing a calm hello helps more than a long explanation.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 317, 'Match a simple question with a simple reply, a short answer that needs nothing more.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 318, 'Close a meeting by reading back who does what by when, in under a minute.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 319, 'Look up from your screen and give a friend the full attention you promised when they need to talk.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 320, 'Offer your neighbor a hand carrying bags in from the car on a rainy fall evening, so they get inside sooner.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 321, 'Aim to reach a spring outdoor event early enough to find parking and the right entrance.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 322, 'Let people know when a question has been answered in a group, so no one else spends time on it.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 323, 'Plan a visit with an older relative around their routine, like rest or dinner times, and keep to the hours they choose.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 324, 'Cheer a friend at the race, recital or game you promised to attend, even if you can only stay a short while.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 325, 'Update your shared work calendar so coworkers can find a free time with you without asking.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 326, 'Hand off your volunteer shift on time and share anything the next person needs to know.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 327, 'Give someone a heads up before sending a big file or long document, and say which part matters to them.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 328, 'Write your question in the chat during a large video call, so the speaker can answer it at a natural pause.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 329, 'Send a friend the update you promised after an appointment or a big talk, so they are not left wondering.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 330, 'Unplug from email on your day off and notice how your own rest feels.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 331, 'Note the doors open time and the start time for a show or game, and aim for somewhere in between.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 332, 'Make a quick note of anything you promised to answer during a call, then reply to each one before bed.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 333, 'Sit near the door in a big meeting if you need to leave early, so you can slip out quietly.'),
