  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 335, 'Hand your cashier any coupons at the start, not after everything is rung up.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 336, 'Bring a book or something small to do in case you arrive early, so being early feels pleasant.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 337, 'Share a calendar invite instead of a long message when you set a plan, so the details land in one tap.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 338, 'Agree on one way to raise a hand in a large video call, so people do not talk over each other.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 339, 'Remind yourself that keeping your word is about care, not perfection, when you slip.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 340, 'Watch for someone who looks lost at a station and point them the right way quickly.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 341, 'Check the date on your tickets for a concert or game tonight, so you arrive on the right evening.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 342, 'Fill in a sign up sheet or poll for your volunteer group as soon as you see it.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 343, 'Run a family meeting about weekend plans in fifteen minutes with a timer on the table.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 344, 'Ask a friend if there is anything you promised them that you have let slide.'),
  ('respecting-other-peoples-time', 345, 'Drop off a donation at the right door during the posted hours, so volunteers are not caught off guard.'),
